    "document": "Rock-Hewn Churches of Lalibela & Axum Heritage - Heritage & Geography: Lalibela contains 11 medieval monolithic rock-hewn churches carved directly from volcanic tuff in the 12th and 13th centuries, including Bete Giyorgis. Axum is the historic cradle of Ethiopian civilization, renowned for towering granite stelae, ancient palaces, and royal tombs.",
